### Get all students
GET http://localhost:5000/students
### Get one student
GET http://localhost:5000/students/1
### Search student using Name
GET http://localhost:5000/students/search?name=Nirmal&email=nirmal@gmail.com
### Create student
POST http://localhost:5000/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Vimaln",
    "email": "iytm6l@gmail.com",
    "age": 26,
    "course": "Java"
}
### Update student
PUT http://localhost:5000/students/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Ranjit",
    "email": "ranjith@gmail.com",
    "age": 24,
    "course": "Full Stack"
}
### Delete student
DELETE http://localhost:5000/students/1